<sp who="#WEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Welzel</hi>.</speaker> <p>Willkommen! Vater An&#x017F;orge, &#x017F;ieht man<lb/>
Dich wider amal.</p></sp><lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom">4*</fw><lb/>
<pb n="52" facs="#f0065"/>
<sp who="#HOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Hornig</hi>.</speaker> <p>Komm&#x017F;t Du o noch amal aus Den&#x2019;n<lb/>
