<sp who="#HOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Hornig</hi>.</speaker> <p>Das is doch d&#x2019;r Fuchs, ni wahr?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Welzel</hi>.</speaker> <p>Nu heert aber uf! Macht m&#x2019;r das<lb/>
