<sp who="#HOR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Hornig</hi>.</speaker> <p>Toten-Ti&#x017F;chler!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#WIE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Wiegand</hi></speaker> <stage>(zu den Anwe&#x017F;enden).</stage> <p>A kann&#x2019;s Vieh behexen.</p></sp><lb/>
